      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proxy couldn’t connect to %@: timed out"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代理服务器无法连接到 %@：连接超时（HTTP 504）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proxy couldn’t connect to %@: timed out (HTTP 504)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代理服务器没有回复就关闭了连接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proxy closed the connection without replying"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代理服务器的回复无法识别，请确认它是 HTTP 代理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proxy’s reply wasn’t understood. Check that it’s an HTTP proxy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "代理服务器的回复无法识别，请确认它是 SOCKS5 代理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The proxy’s reply wasn’t understood. Check that it’s a SOCKS5 proxy"
